// N13r2: HREADY -> hard AE350 HSEL -> bridge control was dominated by
// two long routes in N12 (5.188 + 5.940 ns). Keep the one-hot control
// beside the fixed hard macro at R0C160, as on the qualified Pro Dock.
// These exact FF/driver functions were checked in the N13 netlist.




// N14r1: the slave-ready mux sat at R25C48 between sources/consumer in
// C146/C150, causing a 5.328 + 5.079 ns detour in N13r2. Keep it on the
// same side of the device, midway between the video stage and the CPU.


// Experimental placement; full routing and qualification required.














// N25r2: six-cell bus region from N21r1.







// N29: per-host registered reset copies must stay in ordinary fabric.
CLOCK_LOC "u_gamepads/g_port[0].rst" LOCAL_CLOCK;
CLOCK_LOC "u_gamepads/g_port[1].rst" LOCAL_CLOCK;

